+{"mode": 1, "rep": 0, "prompt": 0, "ctx": 131072, "c": 1, "tokens": 256, "prompt_tokens": 131098, "ttft_s": 0.6774399590001394, "decode_tok_s": 62.7234902371717, "text": "This is a large MLX reference implementation of DeepSeek V4.1 for oMLX. Here are five key points:\n\n- **Model architecture**: Implements DeepSeek V4.1's CSA2 sparse attention (sliding window + compressed KV), single-pass mHC (hyper-connections with 4 parallel residual streams), MoE routing with shared experts, and Engram n-gram hash lookups. Includes a vision encoder (ViT + Aligner) for multimodal input.\n\n- **Custom Metal kernels**: Extensive GPU kernels for FP8/FP4 activation quantization, packed sparse attention (with MMA paths), index scoring/top-k selection, hyper-connection mixing (Sinkhorn normalization, pre/post projections), vocabulary projection, and expert output combination \u2014 all preserving the official reference's numerical semantics.\n\n- **Quantization & conversion pipeline**: Streams official checkpoints into MLX MXFP shards, supports oQ3/oQ4 affine export with sensitivity measurement and imatrix calibration, MoE expert offloading with bounded residency, and SSD-offloaded Engram tables with prefetching.\n\n- **Caching & state management**: `DeepseekV41Cache` holds request-local state (offset, window KV, compressed KV, index K, partial", "text_hash": "fe65c62617f7274bf0a12bd55b5ea128c967ace17f6f3e633366c187c2060c59", "logprobs_hash": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "nlogprobs": 0}
