index 00000000..4be44477
--- /dev/null
+++ b/benchmarks/ds41_sprint3_sources/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# Verified tool-call draft sources
+
+Runtime commit `0a7a450f`, based on served `1f3137bb`. Default off. No native build or checkpoint change.
+
+Enable `DS41_EXTRA_DRAFT=1` together with the served `DS41_MTP_COST_POLICY=1`, DSpark k=4, copy drafts enabled/capped at 4, and `DS41_VERIFY_TILE=0`. Existing cap2/CED/chunk8192/pool3/prefix2 settings remain valid. This source applies to greedy requests with tool schemas and no custom logit processors; ordinary requests retain existing copy/DSpark drafting. It falls back below 1024 context tokens and never proposes more than four tokens, preserving the validated L2..5 target path.
+
+The OpenAI API serializes tool calls as JSON, but this model emits DSML internally. Structural proposals use the native tool schemas and DSML fragments. Unknown values fall back to hidden retrieval, then existing copy/DSpark. Retrieval compares downsampled existing target taps (240 normalized FP32 components), requires cosine >=0.95 and the same anchor token/schema identity, and uses only completed prior responses. The bank has at most 128 schema/anchor buckets of 64 entries (7.5 MiB of raw features plus metadata). Per-request collection is capped at 4096 generated tokens. It resets with the loaded model. Every proposal still goes through the unchanged target verifier.
+
+Tool completion is handled both at model stop/length and at scheduler filtering. The API parser stops a tool call before model EOS; publication must occur before the batch row is removed. Filtering only publishes a trace containing the native closing tag, bounded by the count of emitted tokens. Partial cancelled calls are excluded.
+
+## Warm server gate
+
+A private server on port 10051, process-held gpu.lock, exact served flags, temperature 0, fully warmed before measurement. Same-process off/on pairs use two sets of 12 agent-style requests (read_file, run_tests, search_code; eight schemas supplied). Before measurement the bank sees 12 separate completed seed requests. Measured paths, symbols, line numbers and timeouts are unseen; the second measured set also uses new values. Tool prompt lengths are about 2K and all report zero cached prompt tokens. Seeds are excluded from performance figures.
+
+| Metric | Source off | Source on |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| Mean tool decode, 24 requests/mode | 100.854 tok/s | 111.415 tok/s (+10.47%) |
+| Token-weighted tool decode | 100.603 tok/s | 111.278 tok/s |
+| Mean full tool completion latency | 1.8393 s | 1.7545 s (-4.61%) |
+| Mean copy-heavy decode, 4 requests/mode | 124.935 tok/s | 126.033 tok/s (within 1%) |
+
+All 62 compared responses have identical content and tool-call strings: 48 tool responses, eight copy responses, two short-context controls and four concurrent controls. The one c2 pair per mode also improved directionally, but is an exactness control, not an aggregate-throughput claim. Two-token short-response timings are not meaningful. No prefill claim: copy-case first-use shape warmup changes TTFT without changing decode.
+
+17 focused CPU tests pass (the seven source/lifecycle tests plus ten cost-policy tests). Recorded native-token traces also pass CPU schema/retrieval checks. Target numerical code is unchanged; the preceding EVICT raw gate proves logits/taps/final caches bit-equal for L2..5 and partial commit patterns at 1024 through real 128K. The HTTP gate here compares actual API content/calls; it does not claim returned per-token logprobs (this API omits them).
+
+Lease 203 s, peak physical footprint 231.928 GiB and RSS 226.498 GiB, no guard stop. Server PID40597 exited, releasing its own lock. No native builds were needed.
+
+## Reproduction/evidence
+
+Artifacts originated at `~/llm/ds41/sprint3-ds41o` on the Mac. `http_leg.py` starts its own server under `gpu-exec`, validates the health PID, and terminates/waits for that PID in finally. Run `EXTRA_SOURCE_PROBE=1 BENCH_SCRIPT=sources_ab.py .../python http_leg.py LABEL source` with the harness's profile-c2 copied from the served profile. `server.py` uses the normal production wrapper and external 245 GiB/840 s watchdog. `source_modes.py` toggles proposals and counts source choices; it does not capture GPU tensors. Analysis: `analyze_sources_ab.py LABEL-source.jsonl`.
+
+The earlier `sources-ab-source.jsonl` is retained as a diagnostic: all 62 outputs matched, but retrieval never published before the filter-path fix, so it measures schema-only (+2.4%) and is not the shipping result. `sources-ab-v2-source.jsonl` is the final corrected run. Hidden capture timings in `sources-source.jsonl` are excluded; the capture-off half is only an initial baseline. Raw feature traces stay under the original Mac harness directory.
+
+Paper motivation: [Oilbird](https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.03839), [ToolSpec](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.13519). The fixed-depth, greedy, DSML implementation and these M5 measurements are specific to this runtime.
