+# DS41 pipe1 decoder-half experiment
+
+Branch `ds41-pipe1` starts at served `1f3137bb`. The runtime keeps original
+weights for layers 20–39, embedding/head and all three DSpark stages. It uses
+split-wire's encoder replay from `4ac356b9`; the box owns layers 0–19 and
+layer-20 global KV/index increments. Production configuration is unchanged.
+
+Current status: **phase 3 stopped at the coordinator's box gate** (Sep 25).
+At 8,213 cached tokens, warm CUDA-graph box steps L1–5 took
+9.409 / 9.857 / 10.480 / 11.066 / 11.246 ms, all above the required 8 ms.
+Mac round trips took 10.631–13.057 ms. Boundary validation also failed:
+h19 relative RMS 0.053–0.111, rising to 0.249 after rollback. Do not serve
+this prototype. See `PIPE1_RESULT.md` and `pipe1-gate-result.json` for evidence.
+The 512K gate, further Mac integration and end-to-end quality/throughput
+measurements were skipped on this failed prerequisite.
+
+CPU gates and the earlier GPU load/replay smoke passed: 8,214-token encoder
+fixture replay, finite five-row forward, rollback retaining two rows,
+149.21 GiB peak footprint. That smoke is not a quality or speed result.
+Box recovery commits are `453ad70` (core dumps disabled in both launchers)
+and `0132f5b` (recovered graph gate and rejection evidence). Phase-2 serving
+uses `run_encoder.sh` plus `server.py`; Mac q3 production remains unchanged.
+
+## Checkpoint
+
+`~/models/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-pipe1-mlx`: 834 tensors, 236 quantized modules,
+159,267,422,056 tensor bytes (148.33 GiB). Packed FP4/FP8 values are copied
+unchanged. The actual FP8 checkpoint uses 32×32 UE8M0 block scales; scales are
+repeated into MLX group-32 storage. Dense grouped output projections and Markov
+tables are expanded losslessly to BF16 when required by the served code.
+`conversion-receipt.json` records tensor hashes. No Engram or vision weights
+are needed on the Mac.
+
+CPU checks: all finite FP4/FP8 codes at four exponents decode to the same FP32
+bits; all tensor shapes agree with the decoder; all copied shard headers and
+file sizes agree with the receipt; 60 cache rollback cases pass across the
+128-row window boundary; seven wire tests cover framing and error handling.
+
+## Private validation
+
+Only launch full pipeline legs after split-nv advertises a validated step
+service at `10.10.10.1:10052`. The launcher probes the listener before queueing;
+the child checks again before loading. Each child holds the shared persistent
+GPU lock itself, with a 245 GiB RSS/footprint guard and an 840-second deadline.
+The launcher stops and waits for its own memory-owning PID at the end.
+
+```sh
+PY=~/llm/.venv-ds41-omlx-tiles/bin/python
+P=~/llm/ds41/pipe1
+$PY $P/run_leg.py smoke --label smoke-v1
+$PY $P/run_leg.py quality --label quality-v1
+$PY $P/report_quality.py $P/quality-v1.jsonl --scores $P/scores
+$PY $P/run_leg.py bench --label bench-v1
+$PY $P/report_bench.py $P/bench-v1.jsonl
+$PY $P/run_leg.py needle128 --label needle128-v1
+$PY $P/run_leg.py needle1m --label needle1m-v1
+```
+
+`run_leg.py` sets `MLX_ENABLE_TF32=0`, `DS41_MTP_COST_POLICY=1`,
+`DS41_COPY_DRAFT=1`, `DS41_NATIVE_VERIFY=0`, `DS41_MHC=1`, `DS41_GROWTH=1`,
+`DS41_GATHER=1`, `DS41_INDEX_NAX=1`, `DS41_SPARSE=1`, `DS41_NATIVE_DECODE=1`,
+`DS41_PREFILL_POOL_GIB=3`. DSpark stays at k≤4. Port12143 is loopback-only.
+
+The benchmark warms the HTTP server, then measures 256 generated tokens at
+8K/128K/512K, with three c1 repetitions and one c2 pair. Current c2 scheduling
+alternates complete box/Mac steps; it does not yet overlap the two GPUs.
+Breakdowns distinguish encoder time, round-trip remainder (transport plus
+host work), Mac verification and drafting. Loading time is excluded from warm
+figures. The synthetic load/replay probe is not a throughput benchmark.
+
+Quality uses split1's frozen prompts and full greedy outputs at their original
+case-specific token limits. KL consumes identical reference prefixes in fixed
+L4 blocks, up to64 positions; five real-source continuations score up to128
+positions. Context-copy and DSpark proposal counts are separate. Needles run
+as separate leases. Missing quality observations fail the report.
